# Stata: Stata 18 manuals: [P] programming, [U] language syntax; requirements/languages/stata.md
name     stata do ado

keyword  foreach forvalues while if else program define end local global capture quietly noisily by
keyword  bysort in using of varlist numlist
builtin  display generate gen replace summarize sum regress reg tabulate tab use save describe list
builtin  drop keep merge append sort egen label

line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes
sigil    $    : attr
operators  +-*/^&|!<>=~:
calls
